{"choices":[{"finish_reason":"stop","index":0,"message":{"role":"assistant","content":"My dearest Marie,\n\nThe Parisians have finally given me a sleepwalker. Three acts, though only the first was actually danced; the rest was mere miming, a pantomime of the absurd. A man wandering roofs with a lantern? I confess I found it less terrifying than the price of the wine at Saint-Cloud yesterday. The Seine was calm, but the water charges a premium for its stillness. I ate a decent duck, though the service was slow, and I paid three francs for the privilege of being ignored by the waiter.\n\nLudwig is well, though he complains of the dust. I do not know if it is the air or the wine, but my head feels light, perhaps too light. The French seem to mistake motion for life. I am tired, Marie. Do not worry; I shall rest before dinner.\n\nYours,\nGeorg"}}],"created":1795219396,"model":"qwen","system_fingerprint":"b11429-d81235049","object":"chat.completion","usage":{"completion_tokens":184,"prompt_tokens":1107,"total_tokens":1291,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0}},"id":"chatcmpl-3p2QkzMjf4B54P9GJ2nDIphsgiLiPYdH","timings":{"cache_n":0,"prompt_n":1107,"prompt_ms":1074.335,"prompt_per_token_ms":0.9704923215898826,"prompt_per_second":1030.4048550964085,"predicted_n":184,"predicted_ms":4406.829,"predicted_per_token_ms":24.081032786885245,"predicted_per_second":41.52645814030905}}